          "text": "Added adjunctive therapy for partial-onset seizures in pediatric patients 4 to <17 years of age",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "These Prior Approval supplemental new drug applications report the results of SP0969, a multicenter, double-blind, randomized, placebo-controlled, parallel-group study to evaluate the efficacy and safety of lacosamide as adjunctive therapy in subjects with epilepsy \\ge 4 years to &lt;17 years of age with uncontrolled partial-onset seizures. The revised labeling contained in these supplements provides for the addition of new or worsening seizures to the Adverse Reactions; Postmarketing Experience section, based on a safety signal assessment.",
